SPEC = {'setting': 'Warm Miyazaki-inspired hand-painted Japanese animation food illustration. Honey wood and ivory ceramics. Soft cel shading, no photorealism, no diagrams, no text. No hands.', 'steps': ['Two recognizable whole raw king oyster mushrooms with thick ivory stems and small tan caps on a wooden board, next to lengthwise slices about 5 mm thick retaining the cap shape. Chef knife safely resting beside, no hands. Slices flat and dry, not thick cylindrical scallops.', 'Ivory bowl of thin cold tempura batter with a few small flour lumps, bowl resting in ice. Long cooking chopsticks with handles outside frame lift one 5 mm lengthwise king oyster mushroom slice by the cap end, thin coating dripping. Small ivory plate of dry lightly flour-dusted matching slices beside. No hands, breadcrumbs or panko.', 'Deep stainless pot less than half full frying oil, three separate long thin king oyster mushroom slices frying in airy pale golden tempura coating, small even bubbles. Mesh spider lifts one slice above surface, handle exits crop. Tan mushroom cap visible at one end through thin batter. No hands, no shrimp, no heavy breading.', 'Finished king oyster mushroom tempura on an ivory plate over draining paper, long slices with recognizable small cap and ivory stem, delicate pale-gold airy lace batter. One cut piece displays fully cooked juicy ivory mushroom interior. Lemon wedge and small dish of salt beside. No shrimp, no rice, no panko, no hands.'], 'hero': 'Finished king oyster mushroom tempura on an ivory plate over draining paper, long slices with recognizable small cap and ivory stem, delicate pale-gold airy lace batter. One cut piece displays fully cooked juicy ivory mushroom interior. Lemon wedge and small dish of salt beside. No shrimp, no rice, no panko, no hands.', 'mise': []}
